## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Smell | Effort | Why First |
|----------|-------|--------|-----------|
| 1 | **Assertion-Free Test** | 5 min | Silent false-pass — this test proves nothing today |
| 2 | **Sleepy Test** | 10 min | Flaky + adds 2 s to every CI run |
| 3 | **Conditional Test Logic** | 10 min | Half the logic is never verified per run |
| 4 | **Mystery Guest** | 5 min | Blocks CI and cross-platform execution |
| 5 | **Exception Handling** | 5 min | Quick swap to `Assert.ThrowsException<T>` |
| 6 | **Assertion Roulette** | 3 min | Add message strings to existing assertions |
| 7 | **Magic Number Test** | 10 min | Replace literals with computed constants |
| 8 | **Sensitive Equality** | 10 min | Requires summary to expose structured properties |
| 9 | **Eager Test** | 15 min | Split or tag as integration — involves design decision |
| 10 | **General Fixture** | 2 min | Delete two lines |
